o></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play however fits your mood:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaged Mode:</strong> For when you want to lean in. Prints are faster, progression is snappier, and the shop is busy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Mode:</strong> Turn the game into a &quot;tiny Desktop Companion.&quot; Let your tiny 3d printer run as a cozy screensaver in a corner while you work or study, and check in on your prints whenever you need a break.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's time to create your little workshop!</p>", "short_description": "A cozy 3D printer simulator. Pick your colors, start your prints, and watch voxel models grow. Snap off the supports, ship orders, and buy upgrades for your workshop. Engage actively to grow faster or leave it as a relaxing idle companion on your desktop that you check in on.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705170/4b5b99f113733104c112bdd7abe09e126f18fc22/header.jpg?t=1778793067", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705170/776602ce47f2e796013158628f34fa8b29fabcb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778793067", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705170/776602ce47f2e796013158628f34fa8b29fabcb7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778793067", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon R9 270, GeForce GTX 760, or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\